  # Data-Series-Seasons

  ## Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Notes |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------|
  | include_series | boolean | no |  |
  | season_quarter | number | no | To look up past seasons use both a season_year and season_quarter.  Without both, the active seasons are returned. |
